{"id":3241,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>2025年11月17日上午，我院在九号楼924会议室举办专题报告，特邀教育部大学数学课程教学指导委员会委员、东南大学陈建龙教授以“AI时代线性代数课程教学的探索与实践”为题分享经验。我院部分教师参会，报告会由副院长王鹏主持。</p><p>报告中，陈建龙教授围绕“AI赋能教学的多维路径”“AI辅助课程教学落地”“线性代数课程教学创新实践”三大核心模块，展开系统且深入的阐述。他结合最新政策导向与典型教学案例，生动解读了DeepSeek等智能教学工具在优化教学设计、提升学习效率等方面的应用价值，并分享了其主持的国家级一流课程《线性代数》的建设精髓。从先修课程体系优化、趣味课程导入设计、行列式定义的科学选取、知识图谱的系统构建，到以“双重翻转”为核心的混合式教学模式创新，再到融合“个人课程小结、每周一题、探索题”的多元化评价体系搭建，陈教授全方位、立体化呈现了教学创新的完整实践路径，为在场教师提供了可借鉴、可落地的实操方案。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0o7rafozvPMz94nPzAfLzM7Ll7ZL87Y8Mm7YL4MfL7-boz70gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7UYh7USyZUNWVM4LbLRU4nzfVMzW2LmNaoz67LR9sM4QFLl-DMlCiUlnFMRGYU87Jqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4lDLRvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5607&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/7DCDA8BBE739043E0E52F29097D08776/1B65F5AD/402CA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0o7rafozvPMz94nPzAfLzM7Ll7ZL87Y8Mm7YL4MfL7-boz70gihFp2hmCIa0MYh7UYh7USyZUNWVM4LbLRU4nzfVMzW2LmNaoz67LR9sM4QFLl-DMlCiUlnFMRGYU87Jqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4lDLRvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5607&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0ozNaPUll4M7Q7nPNLaUmnRoRl8MlMYkolrRMmT2LRVkMm70gihFp2hmCIa0LYybU1yiMSybM7lbnNLDLR-8L4UbU4Uan7rfozrRnR98UzAFnlMknzCinNnFL4A2LRGJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4lDLRvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5607&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/39B5594E9FC6024349C40DEA95CD84A8/ECBE65FD/38F00\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0ozNaPUll4M7Q7nPNLaUmnRoRl8MlMYkolrRMmT2LRVkMm70gihFp2hmCIa0LYybU1yiMSybM7lbnNLDLR-8L4UbU4Uan7rfozrRnR98UzAFnlMknzCinNnFL4A2LRGJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4lDLRvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5607&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>整场报告兼具理论高度与实践温度，内容翔实饱满、讲解深入浅出、案例生动鲜活，既有顶层设计的思维引领，又有基层教学的实操干货，引发了与会教师的强烈共鸣。现场互动热烈，参会教师纷纷表示，此次报告干货满满、启发深远，为推进课程教学改革、破解教学实践难题提供了宝贵的理论指导与实践范本，让人受益匪浅。</p><p></p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0MRLaYnm-4LlUDUPz-8U4NYLNnkLRTYfolr2olC4M7QfozN0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiLYyaoShfM7MRnznVozNiU4CYoRGDLmGiLRlaU4Q2MRrFM8MfU87sMmQFLNrRUmGJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4lDLRvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5607&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/75309A4CCE4E995C62806205050C6F45/7CACA766/2ECB0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0MRLaYnm-4LlUDUPz-8U4NYLNnkLRTYfolr2olC4M7QfozN0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyiLYyaoShfM7MRnznVozNiU4CYoRGDLmGiLRlaU4Q2MRrFM8MfU87sMmQFLNrRUmGJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4lDLRvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5607&e=.jpg\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0LmNa4nNLanzCaoPlQRU8n7M4AVolnY7UmVVLmvZnmGPMNC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1y4UYhfLShVnNlbLz6fMl7Yo7n2ozMVolrVLNCbUlUsM7nFUmMkM4GbMz6FL4N4U4CJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4lDLRvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5607&e=.jpg\" draggable=\"false\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B3CA1EFE917A5A28DF93E9EE2F9AD74D/B3B70957/393C6\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0LmNa4nNLanzCaoPlQRU8n7M4AVolnY7UmVVLmvZnmGPMNC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1y4UYhfLShVnNlbLz6fMl7Yo7n2ozMVolrVLNCbUlUsM7nFUmMkM4GbMz6FL4N4U4CJqjfjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4lDLRvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5607&e=.jpg\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp; 最后，王鹏副院长再次对陈建龙教授的倾囊相授表示衷心感谢。他指出，陈教授的报告为我院课程建设与教学创新指明了方向、提供了遵循，具有重要的现实指导意义。未来，我院将积极借力人工智能技术的强大赋能，深入挖掘其在教学资源拓展、教学设计优化、教学评价升级等方面的潜力，通过智能算法整合优质教育素材，生成多元立体的教学内容，持续丰富教学资源供给，不断提升人才培养质量。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=0o7CasM8LZL4nVMPl-sn7VRMRN4MN7YiMNLZMmWkozUDnR90gihFp2hmCIa0n1hRnkh7LkyPU47DMzVfozrRnzCaL4-aoR7PnR-8oRf7MRMFMzGPMmliUlMFL4-sM4GJv2bjo4OeosMZ_dN0qIbtpYyPLzGYg4lDLRvJqd4nx&oid=1867244289&tid=1102&nid=5607&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FCDD01C1651A95CE60320811D